{"uid":"4093057545960a9","name":"test_record_gate_verdict_recovers_from_concurrent_insert_race","fullName":"tests.test_routes_gate_verdicts#test_record_gate_verdict_recovers_from_concurrent_insert_race","historyId":"441a0a4eb532aa1b36e1a9d2fbdaf0b8","time":{"start":1789500693937,"stop":1789500693953,"duration":16},"description":"Two evaluators racing the same version must not 500 on the unique constraint.\n\n    Both concurrent writers read ``None`` from the pre-insert existence check and\n    race to INSERT the same ``(artifact_type, version_key)``. The loser hits\n    ``uq_gate_verdict_artifact_version``; the savepoint fallback must recover by\n    updating the winner's row instead of failing the caller's transaction — and\n    exactly one row must persist. We simulate the race deterministically by\n    forcing the first existence check to miss a row that is already committed.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Two evaluators racing the same version must not 500 on the unique constraint.</p>\n<pre><code>Both concurrent writers read ``None`` from the pre-insert existence check and\nrace to INSERT the same ``(artifact_type, version_key)``. The loser hits\n``uq_gate_verdict_artifact_version``; the savepoint fallback must recover by\nupdating the winner's row instead of failing the caller's transaction — and\nexactly one row must persist. We simulate the race deterministically by\nforcing the first existence check to miss a row that is already committed.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1789500068285,"stop":1789500068286,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1789500068333,"stop":1789500068333,"duration":0},"status":